{"seq":1,"slug":"build-toolchain","title":"构建工具链","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":6,"docCount":19,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain","rating":{"composite":4.04,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":4,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"构建工具链-简介\">构建工具链 简介</h1><p>现代前端工程的复杂度早已超越了&quot;在 HTML 中引入几个 JS 文件&quot;的时代。从 TypeScript 的类型检查到 JSX 的语法转换，从 CSS Modules 的作用域隔离到 Tree-shaking 的死代码消除，从开发环境的热模块替换到生产环境的代码压缩——每一个环节都依赖于构建工具链的精密协作。理解构建工具链，就是理解现代前端工程化的底层基础设施。</p>\n<p>本手册面向有一定前端开发经验、已经使用过 webpack 或 Vite 但希望深入理解其原理的工程师。如果你经常面对&quot;为什么构建这么慢&quot;&quot;为什么打包产物这么大&quot;&quot;如何选择合适的构建工具&quot;等问题，这本手册将为你提供系统而深入的解答。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>基础概念</strong>从根源出发，解释为什么我们需要构建工具、编译（Compilation）与打包（Bundling）与转译（Transpiling）之间的本质区别，以及 JavaScript 模块系统从 CommonJS 到 ESM 的演进历程。这些基础概念是理解后续所有工具的前提。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>打包器</strong>深入四大主流打包工具。Webpack 作为生态最成熟的打包器，其核心概念（Loader、Plugin、Chunk）仍然是行业标准；Vite 以原生 ESM 和按需编译革新了开发体验；Rollup 专注于库打包和 Tree-shaking，其继任者 Rolldown 正在用 Rust 重写以提升性能；esbuild 则以 Go 语言实现，将打包速度提升了两个数量级。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>编译器与转译器</strong>覆盖代码转换层的核心工具。TypeScript 编译器 tsc 的工作原理与配置策略，Babel 的插件架构与其 Rust 替代品 SWC 的性能对比，以及 PostCSS 生态对 CSS 处理的全方位支持——这些工具决定了你的源代码如何被转换为浏览器可执行的最终产物。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>构建框架</strong>聚焦于上层封装。Rsbuild 基于 Rspack（Rust 版 Webpack）提供开箱即用的构建方案，Rslib 专门面向库开发者的构建需求，Turbopack 和 Farm 则代表了下一代构建框架的探索方向。构建框架为开发者屏蔽了底层工具的配置复杂度，让团队能够专注于业务逻辑。</p>\n<p>第五章<strong>优化策略</strong>深入构建产物的性能优化。Tree-shaking 与死代码消除的原理与陷阱，Code Splitting 与懒加载的最佳实践，代码压缩（Minification）与资源压缩（Compression）的技术细节——这些优化手段直接影响应用的加载速度和用户体验。</p>\n<p>第六章<strong>流水线与 DevOps</strong> 关注构建工具在工程化中的实际落地。CI/CD 中的构建集成策略，Monorepo 场景下的构建编排与依赖管理，以及缓存与增量构建在大型项目中的关键作用——将构建能力从开发者本地延伸到整个团队的工程效率。</p>\n<p>构建工具链是前端工程师的&quot;基础设施能力&quot;。本手册的目标不仅是教你如何使用这些工具，更是帮助你理解每个工具的设计哲学和技术取舍，从而在面对新工具、新架构时，能够快速评估并做出明智的技术决策。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础概念","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-we-need-build-tools","title":"为什么需要构建工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/foundations/why-we-need-build-tools"},{"seq":2,"slug":"compilation-vs-bundling-vs-transpiling","title":"编译、打包与转译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/foundations/compilation-vs-bundling-vs-transpiling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"module-systems-and-resolution","title":"模块系统与解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/foundations/module-systems-and-resolution"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"bundlers","title":"打包器","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/bundlers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"webpack-core-concepts","title":"Webpack 核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/bundlers/webpack-core-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vite-architecture","title":"Vite 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/bundlers/vite-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rollup-and-rolldown","title":"Rollup 与 Rolldown","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/bundlers/rollup-and-rolldown"},{"seq":4,"slug":"esbuild","title":"esbuild 极速构建工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/bundlers/esbuild"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"compilers-and-transpilers","title":"编译器与转译器","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/compilers-and-transpilers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tsc-and-typescript-compilation","title":"tsc 与 TypeScript 编译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/compilers-and-transpilers/tsc-and-typescript-compilation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"babel-and-swc","title":"Babel 与 SWC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/compilers-and-transpilers/babel-and-swc"},{"seq":3,"slug":"postcss-and-css-processing","title":"PostCSS 与 CSS 处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/compilers-and-transpilers/postcss-and-css-processing"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"build-frameworks","title":"构建框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/build-frameworks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rsbuild","title":"Rsbuild 构建框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/build-frameworks/rsbuild"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rslib","title":"Rslib 库构建工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/build-frameworks/rslib"},{"seq":3,"slug":"turbopack-and-farm","title":"Turbopack 与 Farm","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/build-frameworks/turbopack-and-farm"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"optimization","title":"优化策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tree-shaking-and-dead-code","title":"Tree-shaking 与死代码消除","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/optimization/tree-shaking-and-dead-code"},{"seq":2,"slug":"code-splitting-and-lazy-loading","title":"代码分割与懒加载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/optimization/code-splitting-and-lazy-loading"},{"seq":3,"slug":"minification-and-compression","title":"压缩与压缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/optimization/minification-and-compression"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"pipeline-and-devops","title":"流水线与 DevOps","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/pipeline-and-devops","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ci-cd-integration","title":"CI/CD 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/pipeline-and-devops/ci-cd-integration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"monorepo-build-strategies","title":"Monorepo 构建策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/pipeline-and-devops/monorepo-build-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"caching-and-incremental-builds","title":"缓存与增量构建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/pipeline-and-devops/caching-and-incremental-builds"}]}]}